# Keep every shipped file BYTE-EXACT.
#
# The three `.vbs` wrappers must stay ASCII with no BOM and the line endings they
# were tested with: wscript decodes them as ANSI, and the test suite asserts
# byte-level properties of them. A checkout that silently rewrote their line
# endings would be a difference nobody would see in a diff but the plugin would
# feel, so no EOL conversion is applied anywhere in this repository.
* -text
